<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Wednesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Oct 15.</p>
<p>CROP			COMBINED (PCT)  POTENTIAL YIELD (Bu/Ac)</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat  49		  39</p>
<p>Winter Wheat	    100		  34</p>
<p>Soft White Spring Wheat80		  49</p>
<p>Oats			 51		  71</p>
<p>Barley		     64		  60</p>
<p>Fall Rye		  100		  30</p>
<p>Peas			 79		  37</p>
<p>Canola		     71		  22</p>
<p>Flax			 84		  20</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
